
# ---- GOLDEN FIXTURE (see golden.env / golden.json / GOLDEN.md for the full manifest) ----
# resetMode=loadvm  |  reset action: QMP 'loadvm golden' (live, no reboot) -> golden-reset.sh
# fixture: clean KolibriOS desktop + TINYPAD 4.1 open & FOCUSED on an empty doc, STEADY
#          non-blinking caret at 1,1 (keyboard-reactive: keys print immediately, no click);
#          TINYPAD menu bar + text page + clear desktop = mouse-reactive surface.
# tweaks: taskbar Clock + Cpu-Usage meter turned OFF (were the only animation); HotAngles
#         Mode=disabled (LiveCD default) so the spiral screensaver never triggers; std-VGA
#         not DPMS-capable so no monitor-blank possible. 3 shots/6s byte-identical.
# golden snapshot 'golden' lives in state.qcow2 (scratch virtio qcow2 attached only to hold
#          it; the LiveCD has no writable disk). NEVER delete state.qcow2.
# golden framebuffer md5 = f6c588427992a2bafaacce321075a1bf  (re-baked 2026-07-13 with usb-tablet device set for SH_POINTER=abs)
# Launch (qemu-streamhost.sh) auto-adds -loadvm golden when the snapshot exists.
